{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】一名6歲女童感染甲型流感併發休克，情況危殆。</p>\n<p>衞生防護中心稱，女童上周四發燒、流鼻水和嘔吐，在屯門醫院治療，兩日後情況轉壞，移送兒童深切治療部，情況危殆。中心指她潛伏期內無外遊，今年度未接種流感疫苗。6月至今累計24宗兒童感染流感嚴重個案。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:19:34.578614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:12:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T12:37:44.762389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:17:40.715314+00:00","content_hash":"234bc6609160365df17f7191bfbe38fe9831601751c7b292b1193ed55ec8c22b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}